        {
          "name": "rho_marker",
          "docs": [
            "§2.4.2 — rho uniqueness. `init` is the enforcement: a second deposit with the same rho",
            "cannot create this account and the WHOLE TRANSACTION fails, so reuse is a rejected tx",
            "instead of a note that proves fine and can never be spent. The depositor pays, because it",
            "is the depositor's own rho and the alternative is a free way to make someone else's",
            "account rent-exempt."
          ],
          "writable": true,
          "pda": {
