        "IDENTICAL to the former `Deposit` event: {commitment[32], leaf_index u64 LE, root[32]}",
        "= 80 bytes incl. the 8-byte event discriminator. The wallet leaf-scanner is length-based,",
        "so historical `Deposit` events remain valid leaves across the program upgrade. Do NOT",
        "change the field order/types."
